---
// Resume summary — a scannable web resume so the page itself tells the story
// before someone has to download a DOCX. Added 2026-05-20.
---
<!-- ═══════════ RESUME SUMMARY ═══════════ -->
<section class="block resume" id="resume">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">07 · Resume</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Kevin Carpenter, <em>at a glance.</em></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Senior Full-Stack Architect · Headless Commerce · Regulated Systems · Enterprise Integrations
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="resume__grid reveal">
      <div class="resume__summary">
        <h3 class="resume__h">Summary</h3>
        <p>
          14+ years designing and shipping commerce platforms, regulated systems, and enterprise integrations. Deep experience across React, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js, Shopify, BigCommerce, NetSuite, AWS, Azure, and serverless architecture. I build systems that connect storefronts to operational infrastructure without sacrificing scale, security, or maintainability.
        </p>

        <h3 class="resume__h">Core Strengths</h3>
        <ul class="resume__list">
          <li>Headless and hybrid commerce</li>
          <li>ERP and middleware architecture</li>
          <li>Regulated and compliance-heavy platforms</li>
          <li>Technical leadership and long-term partnerships</li>
          <li>Performance, reliability, and systems integration</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <aside class="resume__side">
        <div class="resume__card">
          <h3 class="resume__h">Core Stack</h3>
          <div class="resume__chips">
            <span class="chip is-key">React</span>
            <span class="chip is-key">Next.js</span>
            <span class="chip is-key">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="chip is-key">Node.js</span>
            <span class="chip">Shopify</span>
            <span class="chip">BigCommerce</span>
            <span class="chip">NetSuite</span>
            <span class="chip">Celigo</span>
            <span class="chip">AWS</span>
            <span class="chip">Azure Functions</span>
            <span class="chip">Cosmos DB</span>
            <span class="chip">PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="chip">Supabase</span>
            <span class="chip">Sanity</span>
            <span class="chip">Payload</span>
            <span class="chip">Tailwind</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="resume__h">Highlights</h3>
          <ul class="resume__list resume__list--mono">
            <li><strong>Principal Architect</strong> · Rust-Oleum Home · React hybrid on BigCommerce</li>
            <li><strong>Lead Architect</strong> · DC iLottery · regulated iGaming platform</li>
            <li><strong>10-yr Partner</strong> · Nuun · NetSuite ↔ Headless Shopify</li>
            <li><strong>Founder / Engineer</strong> · AgeVerify · privacy-first IDV SDK</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg resume__download" href="assets/files/Kevin%20Resume.pdf" download>Download Full Resume ↓</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .resume__grid {
    margin-top: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .resume__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .resume__h {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .resume__summary > .resume__h:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .resume__summary p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .resume__list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .resume__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .resume__list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 9px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .resume__list--mono li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  .resume__list--mono li strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .resume__card {
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--bg-2);
    display: grid;
    gap: 22px;
  }
  .resume__card .resume__h {
    margin: 0 0 -6px;
  }

  .resume__chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .resume__download {
    margin-top: 6px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
